          "parsed": {
            "units": [
              {
                "text": "要避免您的CDL/CLP被降级或取消，您必须确保您的医疗认证状态保持有效。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Medical Certification Requirements#3_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context states that if medical certification status becomes 'not certified', DMV will send a notice and may cancel the CDL/CLP, implying the need to keep it valid."
              },
              {
                "text": "如果您的医疗认证状态变为“未认证”，DMV会向您发送“不合规及驾照降级通知”。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Medical Certification Requirements#3_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context explicitly states this."
              },
              {
                "text": "您需要在收到通知后55天内提交更新的医疗检查员证书（MCSA-5876），否则DMV将取消您的CDL/CLP。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Medical Certification Requirements#3_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context states that if the CDL/CLP holder does not submit an updated medical examiner's certificate within 55 days, DMV will cancel the CDL/CLP."
              },
              {
                "text": "此外，在办理任何驾照业务（地址变更或补发驾照除外）时，您必须认证您所从事的四种联邦驾驶类型之一。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Medical Certification Requirements#3_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context states that when conducting any driver license transaction (except address change or duplicate license), you must certify your driving type from the four federal types."
              },
              {
                "text": "如果您自我认证为非豁免驾驶类型（NA或NI），您还必须保持一份最新的USDOT医疗检查员证书存档于DMV。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Medical Certification Requirements#3_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context explicitly states this requirement."
              }
            ]
          },
